> REVIEW: Unspecified amount: Salt + pepper

== Ingredients ==

Gather the following ingredients: @ground beef{3/10%lb}, @jasmine rice{3/10%cup} (dry), @carrots{8/5%oz} (shredded), @scallions{4/5} (sliced), @butter{2/5%tbsp}, @sesame oil{2/5%tbsp}, @gluten-free tamari{1/20%cup}, @honey or brown sugar{2/5%tbsp}, @rice vinegar{1/5%tbsp}, @ginger{1/5%tsp} (grated), @gluten-free mayo{1/10%cup}, @gluten-free sriracha{2/5%tsp}, @sesame seeds{1/5%tsp}, @Salt + pepper{}.

== Preparation ==

Cook jasmine rice according to its package. Saute carrots and brown the beef with ginger and sesame oil. Add tamari, sweetener and vinegar. Mix mayonnaise and sriracha; serve the beef and carrots over rice with scallions and sesame.
